  "data_availability_text": "Data Availability:Metagenomic sequencing data are available in Qiita under study ID 13662 (36). Mass spectrometry data (.mzXML format) are available in MassIVE under ID MSV000087087. The classical molecular networking job is available in GNPS at the following link: https://gnps.ucsd.edu/ProteoSAFe/status.jsp?task=90f1ba6e1e4d4d89b75b9017a0631983 (37). The feature-based molecular networking job is available in GNPS at the following link: https://gnps.ucsd.edu/ProteoSAFe/status.jsp?task=0b828a2a6f224fb293de1fe39bee5fc5 (38). The code utilized for these analyses are available at https://github.com/ahdilmore/BEAM_MultiOmics.",
